  "title": "oids: Read SMI library configuration files",
  "description": "According to `man 3 smi_config` when the tag parameter of `smiInit`\nfunction is not `NULL` it reads the global and user configuration files\nand executes all global and tagged statements\n\nThe `smiInit` completely ignores both configuration files when tag is\nNULL.\n\n/etc/smi.conf\n$HOME/.smirc",
