          "id": 1801908998,
          "type": null,
          "body": "For reference `tcpdump` is also calling `smiInit` with string.\n\nFrom https://github.com/the-tcpdump-group/tcpdump/blob/440d155f24098c5a7501bd41a0edaeab223af32c/netdissect.c#L72\n```\nsmiInit(\"tcpdump\");\n```\n\nIf this gets merged then Wireshark would share MIB configs with `tcpdump`.",
